hetero: fork table kept; the produce fallback matches the desktop ETI reading

The fork's grammar table stays for the upstream rows. The desktop heteronym
filter forces produce through the same ETI spelling; persona and personas
keep their forced readings. Quality/address stay out by decision and jose
reads from its dict.
High bytes count as word bytes. Applied at build time.
